//ORC LEATHER +3//
COPY "rick_bigg_mod/items/LEAT16.itm" "override"
	SAY NAME1 "Studded Leather Armor"
	SAY UNIDENTIFIED_DESC "Studded leather armor has little in common with normal leather armor. Instead of a hardened shell, studded leather offers hundreds of metal rivets affixed to a supple backing. The numerous studs form a flexible coat of metal that helps to turn aside slashing and cutting attacks, while the leather is little more than a means of securing the rivets in place. 

STATISTICS:

Armor Class: 7 (5 vs. slashing, 6 vs. piercing and missile)
Requires:
 6 Strength

Weight: 25"

	SAY NAME2 "Orc Leather +3"
	SAY DESC "This ghastly armor was taken from an orc camp destroyed by barbarians. Instead of standard metal rivets, like normal studded leather, this orc leather is instead laced with hundreds of fire-hardened bones. Finger bones, ribs, and skulls cover the armor, acting much like the traditional metal rivets. Powerful orcish enchantments give the armor special resistance to missile  and piercing attacks, but the repulsiveness of the armor reduces the wearer's Charisma.

STATISTICS:

Equipped abilities:
– Charisma: -1
– +10% resistance to missile damage
– +10% resistance to piercing damage

Armor Class: 4 (2 vs. slashing, 3 vs. piercing and missile)
Requires:
 6 Strength

Weight: 7"

























//HAWKSIGHT +2//
