Speed Factor: 10
Proficiency Type: Two-handed Sword
Type: Two-handed
Requires:
 14 Strength

Weight: 15"

SAY NAME2 "Berserkering Sword +3"
	SAY DESC "This sword performs perfectly under every test, save the heat of battle. Upon entering combat, the wielder have a lot o chance to go berserk, killing everything within reach until either calming down or falling unconscious. A very powerful sword, but one must decide whether or not it is worth the risk.

STATISTICS:

Combat abilities:
– Chance to go berserk 25% every hit (you have the same bonuses as a Berserker Rage, but cannot be controlled).

THAC0: +3
Damage: 2d6+3 (slashing)
Speed Factor: 7
Proficiency Type: Two-handed Sword
Type: Two-handed
Requires:
 14 Strength

Weight: 12" 






//FLAME OF THE NORTH +2//
COPY "rick_bigg_mod/items/SW2H12.itm" "override"
	SAY NAME1 "Two-Handed Sword"
	SAY UNIDENTIFIED_DESC "The two-handed sword is a derivative of the long sword. Weaponsmiths have always looked for ways to improve existing weapons. In an effort to improve the long sword, the blade was lengthened. Eventually, the handle had to be extended and two hands became necessary to properly swing the sword. The primary function of two-handed swords is cleaving mounted knights and breaking up pike formations.

STATISTICS:

Damage: 2d6 (slashing)
Speed Factor: 10
Proficiency Type: Two-handed Sword
Type: Two-handed
Requires:
 14 Strength

Weight: 15"

SAY NAME2 "Flame of the North +2"
	SAY DESC "The title does not refer to the blade itself, but rather to the woman who originally wielded it in the icy hinterlands of Faerûn. Her name was Carerra, and she was a veritable firestorm that swept across arctic trolls and the northern orcish tribes. She was a hated enemy of many a shaman whose magic often floundered against her fury. After a lifetime of raucous battle, it was old age that eventually claimed her. The sword was passed to her granddaughter, an adventurer, who presumably brought it to Amn.

STATISTICS:

Equipped abilities:
– Magic Resistance: +10%

THAC0: +2, +4 vs. evil
Damage: 1d10+2, +4 vs. evil
Damage type: Slashing
Speed Factor: 8
Proficiency Type: Two-handed sword
Type: Two-handed
Requires:
 14 Strength

Weight: 10" 







