SAY NAME2 "Sword of Chaos +2"
	SAY DESC "The blade of Sarevok, brother of <CHARNAME>, used in the battle they fought in faraway Baldur's Gate. <CHARNAME> prevailed, destroying Sarevok's plans and rescuing the Sword Coast from the brink of war. The sword itself defies identification, likely forged specifically for Sarevok to best focus the infernal energy he hoped to control. Much of its power died with him.

STATISTICS:

Equipped abilities:
- +10% Magic Resistance

Combat abilities:
– Each hit drains 1 Hit Point from the target and transfers it to the wielder. This will not heal beyond the wielder's maximum.

THAC0: +2
Damage: 1d10+2 (slashing)
Speed Factor: 8
Proficiency Type: Two-handed Sword
Type: Two-handed
Requires:
 14 Strength

Weight: 10" 



