Speed Factor: 10
Proficiency Type: Two-handed Sword
Type: Two-handed
Requires:
 14 Strength

Weight: 15"

	SAY NAME2 "Carsomyr +6"
	SAY DESC "Even a holy relic as powerful as Carsomyr is made even greater when combined with the Eye of Tyr.

